(reference XY line, taking a 30 mm spacing between projectors:) Tj
T*
(* Point A: 35 mm above HP and 25 mm in front of VP.) Tj
T*
(* Point B: 40 mm above HP and 30 mm behind VP.) Tj
T*
(* Point C: 25 mm below HP and 45 mm behind VP.) Tj
T*
(* Point D: 30 mm below HP and 20 mm in front of VP.) Tj
T*
(Step-by-Step Construction Procedure:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Draw horizontal reference line XY.) Tj
T*
(* 2. Projector for Point A \(1st Quadrant\): Draw vertical projector line. Mark a'' 35) Tj
T*
(mm above XY. Mark a 25 mm below XY.) Tj
T*
(* 3. Projector for Point B \(2nd Quadrant, 30 mm right\): Draw vertical projector. Mark) Tj
T*
(b'' 40 mm above XY. Mark b 30 mm above XY \(both above XY\).) Tj
T*
(* 4. Projector for Point C \(3rd Quadrant, 30 mm right\): Draw vertical projector. Mark) Tj
T*
(c 45 mm above XY \(top view\). Mark c'' 25 mm below XY \(front view\).) Tj
T*
(* 5. Projector for Point D \(4th Quadrant, 30 mm right\): Draw vertical projector. Mark) Tj
T*
(d'' 30 mm below XY. Mark d 20 mm below XY \(both below XY\).) Tj
T*
(* 6. Verify with clear dimension callouts and perpendicular construction guidelines.) Tj
T*
