T*
(- Center at a, radius ab1 = 64.95 mm, rotate arc to intersect locus of B \(at 73.03 mm) Tj
T*
(below XY\) -> Locate final top view b. Connect a-b.) Tj
T*
(- Center at a'', radius a''b2'' = 53.03 mm, rotate arc to intersect locus of B'' \(at) Tj
T*
(52.5 mm above XY\) -> Locate final front view b''. Connect a''-b''.) Tj
