T*
(- Check that a'' and a lie on the same vertical projector, and b'' and b lie on the same) Tj
T*
(vertical projector.) Tj
T*
(- Apparent angles measured: alpha approx 45 deg, beta approx 55 deg.) Tj
T*
(* Step 6: Traces HT and VT:) Tj
T*
(- Extend front view b''a'' to intersect XY at h''. Draw perpendicular projector from h'') Tj
T*
(to intersect extended top view ba at HT.) Tj
